**Security decisions implemented:**
- Identity derived from verified session only, never from request body
- Ownership predicate in WHERE clause (via RLS policies)
- 404 for non-owned resources to prevent enumeration
- Role changes restricted to admins with self-role-change prevention
- UUID validation for user IDs
- Rate limiting on the endpoint
- Structured logging with sanitized values
- RLS enabled with per-operation policies and no `USING (true)`
